+    on main), cold-L2 graph replays; the fastest variant that is <= QKV_GATE_RATIO x master and passes the
+    parity check wins, else master. Sets state['qkv_split_ok'] = {(class, windowed): (fork, prio)}.
+    Never raises; prints GATE lines per key and PATH CHOSEN last."""
